{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is The Enigma Case?\u00a0\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Enigma Cases</strong> is a co-op detective game set in Sunderwood, an alternative town in 2000s America. Play solo or with up to 4 players and step into the role of a real detective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine crime scenes, gather and analyze physical and digital evidence, follow suspects\u2019 trails, and interrogate them at the police station. Every decision you make brings you closer to uncovering the truth behind each case. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/d9b28c2b58591ceffe5221eff87e9ea1.poster.avif?t=1771279558\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/d9b28c2b58591ceffe5221eff87e9ea1.webm?t=1771279558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/d9b28c2b58591ceffe5221eff87e9ea1.mp4?t=1771279558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Varied Cases</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each case tells a unique story, ranging from murders and accidents to suspicious deaths. No two investigations are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore realistic locations, from caf\u00e9s and apartments to highways and restricted areas. Every crime scene is carefully designed and filled with clues waiting to be discovered, analyzed, and connected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/0b33d8a92df28bd2f8fac48e816a9d4a.poster.avif?t=1771279558\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/0b33d8a92df28bd2f8fac48e816a9d4a.webm?t=1771279558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/0b33d8a92df28bd2f8fac48e816a9d4a.mp4?t=1771279558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Detective Roles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigations are shaped by different detective approaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a <strong>Field Detective</strong>, you collect physical evidence, examine crime scenes in detail, and interrogate suspects face to face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a <strong>Cyber Detective</strong>, you focus on digital trails. Analyze emails, GPS records, social media accounts, databases, and security systems to uncover hidden connections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/f600dc1e75ade4f3279718b80487508d.poster.avif?t=1771279558\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/f600dc1e75ade4f3279718b80487508d.webm?t=1771279558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/f600dc1e75ade4f3279718b80487508d.mp4?t=1771279558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Cooperation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve cases together with your friends in co-op play for 1\u20134 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player can take on a different role, share findings, and combine evidence to move the investigation forward. Cooperation and communication are essential to uncovering complex truths. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/6db2ab1ffe699d78cf5283d5af2be877.poster.avif?t=1771279558\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/6db2ab1ffe699d78cf5283d5af2be877.webm?t=1771279558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/6db2ab1ffe699d78cf5283d5af2be877.mp4?t=1771279558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In-Depth Investigations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use professional tools at the police station to advance your case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze CCTV footage, scan DNA traces, access restricted databases, repair distorted audio recordings, and examine forensic and toxicological reports. Perform autopsies, identify causes of death, and uncover critical evidence that can incriminate your suspect. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Realistic and Engaging Stories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every case is built around detailed characters, realistic environments, and carefully written scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover victims\u2019 pasts, explore their homes, search confidential documents, find secret rooms, crack safes, or hack security systems. Expect psychological tension, unexpected twists, and surprising outcomes at the end of each investigation.<br>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Add to Your Wishlist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <strong>The Enigma Cases</strong> to your wishlist and join our Discord to support development, share feedback, and become part of our growing detective community.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1771279558\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1771279558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1771279558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3062170?t=1771279558","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3062170?t=1771279558","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/6b595f93ca00fa3103c285b27a72e8b9d675fdc0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771279558","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/6b595f93ca00fa3103c285b27a72e8b9d675fdc0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771279558","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Since our game is a detective game, there are different stories in each case.\r\nFor example, the cases focus on solving how the deceased people died, whether it was murder or suicide.\r\n\r\nWhen we take the case and go to the scene where the victim died, we reach the adult content there. "},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/9ba9b07730127982f7c4bc2d030b594d.avif?t=1771279558\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras_big/9ba9b07730127982f7c4bc2d030b594d.avif?t=1771279558 width=800 height=800 /></span></p></p><br><h1>WISHLIST &amp; FOLLOW \u2728</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/26aee42423b9e0de06f39ebd5afcf9bb.avif?t=1771279558\" width=1232 height=400 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is The Enigma Case?\u00a0\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Enigma Cases</strong> is a co-op detective game set in Sunderwood, an alternative town in 2000s America. Play solo or with up to 4 players and step into the role of a real detective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine crime scenes, gather and analyze physical and digital evidence, follow suspects\u2019 trails, and interrogate them at the police station. Every decision you make brings you closer to uncovering the truth behind each case. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/d9b28c2b58591ceffe5221eff87e9ea1.poster.avif?t=1771279558\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/d9b28c2b58591ceffe5221eff87e9ea1.webm?t=1771279558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/d9b28c2b58591ceffe5221eff87e9ea1.mp4?t=1771279558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Varied Cases</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each case tells a unique story, ranging from murders and accidents to suspicious deaths. No two investigations are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore realistic locations, from caf\u00e9s and apartments to highways and restricted areas. Every crime scene is carefully designed and filled with clues waiting to be discovered, analyzed, and connected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/0b33d8a92df28bd2f8fac48e816a9d4a.poster.avif?t=1771279558\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/0b33d8a92df28bd2f8fac48e816a9d4a.webm?t=1771279558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/0b33d8a92df28bd2f8fac48e816a9d4a.mp4?t=1771279558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Detective Roles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigations are shaped by different detective approaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a <strong>Field Detective</strong>, you collect physical evidence, examine crime scenes in detail, and interrogate suspects face to face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a <strong>Cyber Detective</strong>, you focus on digital trails. Analyze emails, GPS records, social media accounts, databases, and security systems to uncover hidden connections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/f600dc1e75ade4f3279718b80487508d.poster.avif?t=1771279558\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/f600dc1e75ade4f3279718b80487508d.webm?t=1771279558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/f600dc1e75ade4f3279718b80487508d.mp4?t=1771279558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Cooperation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve cases together with your friends in co-op play for 1\u20134 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player can take on a different role, share findings, and combine evidence to move the investigation forward. Cooperation and communication are essential to uncovering complex truths. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/6db2ab1ffe699d78cf5283d5af2be877.poster.avif?t=1771279558\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/6db2ab1ffe699d78cf5283d5af2be877.webm?t=1771279558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/6db2ab1ffe699d78cf5283d5af2be877.mp4?t=1771279558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In-Depth Investigations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use professional tools at the police station to advance your case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze CCTV footage, scan DNA traces, access restricted databases, repair distorted audio recordings, and examine forensic and toxicological reports. Perform autopsies, identify causes of death, and uncover critical evidence that can incriminate your suspect. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Realistic and Engaging Stories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every case is built around detailed characters, realistic environments, and carefully written scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover victims\u2019 pasts, explore their homes, search confidential documents, find secret rooms, crack safes, or hack security systems. Expect psychological tension, unexpected twists, and surprising outcomes at the end of each investigation.<br>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Add to Your Wishlist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <strong>The Enigma Cases</strong> to your wishlist and join our Discord to support development, share feedback, and become part of our growing detective community.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1771279558\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1771279558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1771279558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Red Core Interactive"],"dlc":[4132820,4132830,4148340],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/header.jpg?t=1771279558","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3062170/1958276376/1c0f3aa7323e6f6ff5fa687787743fbac23156ba/1762867082/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762868609","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3062170/1958276376/1c0f3aa7323e6f6ff5fa687787743fbac23156ba/1762867082/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762868609","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3062170/1958276376/1c0f3aa